# NHL data origin (public URL, not a secret). Browser -> Cloudflare nhl-gateway
# -> propsports-api. Defaults to https://nhl-api.propbetedge.ai when unset.
# Local development: run the gateway with `npx wrangler dev --env dev` in
# LHBUSA/propsports-api-worker/nhl-gateway and point this at it.
# Never put PropSports / dashboard / odds credentials in this app or in Vercel.
VITE_NHL_GATEWAY_URL=
